cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Romenagri — Reversible Transliteration Library (Perso-Arabic seed)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
authors:
  - family-names: Choudhary
    given-names: Abhishek
    affiliation: AyeAI
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/project-ilm/romenagri"
abstract: >
  Deterministic, reversible transliteration engine (Romenagri, GPL 2003)
  underlying the Hindawi Programming System (2004) and Project ILM. This seed
  packages the core with Perso-Arabic data for the 41 Perso-Arabic-family
  languages demonstrated at ilm.codes/map.html.
